1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,706
Welcome to Rover Trading,

2
00:00:02,706 --> 00:00:06,594
where you learn to read the market, one candle at a time.

3
00:00:06,594 --> 00:00:10,142
The landing page opens with a live price action lab,

4
