11
00:00:33,276 --> 00:00:36,640
and terms and admissions guide visitors to enrol.

12
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:40,449
New students create an RT account in seconds.

13
00:00:40,449 --> 00:00:44,327
Members sign in to a dashboard for applications, payments,

14
00:00:44,327 --> 00:00:46,600
and the protected learners portal.

15
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:50,270
Admins approve proofs of payment,

16
00:00:50,270 --> 00:00:54,791
